WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
An ICT System brings components together to deliver an intended function.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Networks link devices and help components exchange information.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
A system view explains purpose and ownership. A network view explains connectivity.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Use recorded relationships to explore how components, networks and ICT Systems fit together.
